#: ../../../tutorials/04-matrix-multiplication.md:196
msgid ""
"As a rule, make tile sizes (`BM`, `BN`, `BK`) static — they are fixed for a "
"given kernel variant and the compiler needs them for register allocation and "
"Tensor Core mapping. Make problem dimensions that change often (such as "
"sequence length or batch size) dynamic."
